# Dependencies & Imports

## Path Aliases

```tsx
// ✅ ALWAYS use the @/ alias
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';
import { useAuth } from '@/features/auth/hooks';
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils';

// ❌ NEVER use long relative paths
import { Button } from '../../../components/ui/button';
```

## Dependency Matrix

| From ↓ / To → | app/ | features/ | components/ | services/ | shared/ | lib/ |
|---------------|------|-----------|-------------|-----------|---------|------|
| **app/** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **features/** | ❌ | ⚠️* | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **components/** | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **services/** | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **shared/** | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
| **lib/** | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |

> ⚠️* Features can only import from other features through public exports

## Import Order

```tsx
// 1. React and external libraries
import { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import { useQuery } from '@tanstack/react-query';

// 2. UI Components
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';
import { Card } from '@/components/ui/card';

// 3. Features (hooks, api)
import { useAuth } from '@/features/auth/hooks';
import { professionalsApi } from '@/features/professionals/api';

// 4. Shared (types, enums, constants)
import { UserRole } from '@/shared/enums/roles.enum';
import type { UserDTO } from '@/shared/dtos/user.dto';

// 5. Utils and lib
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils';

// 6. Styles (if applicable)
import './styles.css';
```

## Feature Exports

Each feature should expose a clear public API:

```tsx
// features/auth/index.ts
export { useAuth, useLogin, useLogout } from './hooks';
export { authApi } from './api';
export type { LoginDTO, RegisterDTO } from './types';
```

## Circular Imports

```tsx
// ❌ FORBIDDEN: Circular dependency
// auth/hooks.ts imports from professionals/hooks.ts
// professionals/hooks.ts imports from auth/hooks.ts

// ✅ SOLUTION: Move shared logic to shared/
```

## Barrel Export Rules

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD: Import from barrel
import { Button, Card, Dialog } from '@/components/ui';

// ✅ ALSO GOOD: Direct import (better tree-shaking)
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';
```
